safix::bad_recipient

  × age1-not-a-key is not a well-formed age recipient.
  │ 
  │ An age X25519 recipient is age1 followed by 58 bech32 characters
  │ (no 1, b, i or o). This checks the shape and nothing else: whether anyone
  │ holds the private half is not knowable from here.
  │ 
  │ They mint one with safix keygen on their own machine, or convert an
  │ ed25519 ssh key they already hold:
  │ 
  │     ssh-to-age -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
